  "display_title": "Gimme Some Love!",
  "description": "The new semester is buzzing with students eager to make friends. Nam Soo-Min, however, has only one goal: survive the year without getting dragged into anyone’s business. Enter Lee Jae-Ha, the ultimate social butterfly and Soo-Min’s brand-new classmate and roommate. For someone like Jae-Ha, being ignored is unthinkable. And Soo-Min? He just made the mistake of catching his eye. Try as he might to escape, Soo-Min finds himself tangled up in Jae-Ha’s wild orbit. \n\n *“How much longer are you gonna ignore me? Give me some attention!”*\n\nIt’s the unstoppable force of popularity versus the immovable wall of indifference... and the semester has only just begun!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
